orig.t:
My eyes will fail, my ears will fail,
and likewise also my body;
all that depends on the body will fail
why, Pālita, are you heedless? {1.12}

5. Well done for making friendship, and
for proclaiming eternal love,
if to these things one gives consent,
you’re praiseworthy to those who know.”

When will I give goods for lodgings,
couches, seats, cushions and pillows?
My intention is now fulfilled. {1.417}
